    description: "Pass 13: 218 nodes have IDs like 'packages/hypergumbo-core/tests/test_http_linker.py::http_client::229'. Affects cross-language edge detection (50 spurious edges show 'language=packages/.../test_message_queue_linker.py'). Bundles with VV/JJJ/HHH/PPP under classification-axes audit."  # adc1
    fields:  # adc1
      statement: "All node.id values follow the schema <language>:<path>:<span>:<name>:<kind> with single-colon separators."  # adc1
      root_cause: "Linker passes (http-linker, message-queue-linker, database-query-linker, subprocess-linker, graphql-resolver-linker) emit call_site nodes via a separate path-prefixed schema (<path>::<framework_role>::<line> with double-colon separators), bypassing the canonical node ID factory used by language analyzers."  # adc1
